## Why This Is Asked

This question probes ability to design end-to-end scalable ingestion with strong isolation and cost discipline, plus onboarding automation.

## Key Concepts

- Tenant isolation strategies (namespaces, resource groups)
- Ingestion options (IoT Hub vs Event Hubs) and scaling
- Data encryption with CMK and Key Vault
- RBAC, Service Principals, least privilege
- Onboarding automation (ARM/Bicep/Terraform), CI/CD
- Monitoring, auditing, budgets

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo onboarding snippet (illustrative only)
async function onboardTenant(tenantId){
  await createEventHubNamespace(`tenant-${tenantId}-eh`);
  await createStorageAccount(`tenant${tenantId}sa`);
  await assignRBAC(tenantId, 'Contributor');
  await configureCMK(`tenant-${tenantId}-cmk`);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you test isolation boundaries at scale?
- What are the trade-offs of per-tenant storage vs a shared data lake with tagging?

## Why This Is Asked
This tests practical cost control and data lifecycle in Azure Storage. It requires using lifecycle rules, storage tiers, and operational checks.

## Key Concepts
- Blob lifecycle management
- Hot/Cool/Archive tiers
- Delete and legal hold considerations
- Soft delete and versioning

## Code Example

```javascript
// Conceptual policy object (Azure uses JSON, this illustrates structure)
const policy = {
  rules: [
    {
      name: 'Move60toArchive',
      enabled: true,
      definition: {
        filters: { blobTypes: ['blockBlob'], prefixMatch: ['uploads/'] },
        actions: { baseBlob: { tierToArchive: { daysSinceModificationGreaterThan: 60 } } }
      }
    },
    {
      name: 'DeleteOld365',
      enabled: true,
      definition: {
        filters: { blobTypes: ['blockBlob'], prefixMatch: ['uploads/'] },
        actions: { baseBlob: { delete: { daysSinceModificationGreaterThan: 365 } } }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test the policy in a non-production storage account?
- What are potential pitfalls with Archive tier access latency and restores?

